msgid "Minimum severity captured in the panel log buffer and on-disk log file. Warning is a good default - bump it down to Info or Debug when debugging packing issues."
msgstr "面板日志缓冲区和磁盘日志文件中记录的最低严重级别。「警告」是合适的默认值 — 调试打包问题时可下调至「信息」或「调试」。"

#: addon/preferences.py:62
msgid "Mirror your project folder inside the portable package. Assets that already live inside the project are kept in place; anything outside is copied into a category subfolder (textures/, sounds/, libraries/...). All paths become //-relative. The result is a self-contained project directory you can keep working with."
msgstr "在便携包内镜像你的项目文件夹。已在项目内的资源保持原位；外部资源复制到类别子文件夹（textures/、sounds/、libraries/...）。所有路径变为 // 相对路径。结果是一个可继续使用的独立项目目录。"

